      "message": "Serve the fonts and lay the foundations\n\nThe pages are set in two faces with one job each: Familjen Grotesk for\nheadings and Instrument Sans, a step heavier than regular, for everything\nread; JetBrains Mono for code. The three files ride in the binary and are\nserved under content-addressed names beside the stylesheet, which names\nthem through placeholders filled at startup, so nothing on a page asks a\nthird party for anything. The content policy admits fonts from this\norigin and nothing else new.\n\nThe stylesheet gets one token set that exists in three states: light on\nthe root, dark under the system preference unless light was chosen, dark\nagain when chosen. A fresh visitor follows the system; the switch cycles\nlight, dark and auto, and choosing auto forgets the choice. The older\nnames the page rules still read are aliases of the new tokens, and a test\nrefuses a token read anywhere that is not declared on the root.\n\nThe primitives every page will be built from are here too, replacing the\nold button, dot, check, empty and once-only rules in place: buttons,\nfields, inputs, checks, segments, chips, panels, rows, notices, an icon\nsprite rendered once per page, and an avatar that gives each person a\nstable hue and each agent a squircle with a live dot.\n\nChange-Id: Ifoundations0124\nTask: t-1hkpptrvw4e64dfb9xxn7bv4r4\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
